OL,4,Apassengers rescued after New Orleans
OL,5,Acruise ship collision
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe exact cause of the crash remains
OL,8,Funder investigation, but US Coast Guard
OL,9,FCapt Melanie Burnham said: "There seems
OL,10,Fto be some type of a loss of steering."
